# Life Explorer Agent Rules

Before modifying Life Explorer or generating lessons, read:

- `docs/features/life-explorer/PHILOSOPHY.md`
- `docs/features/life-explorer/LESSON_CONTRACT.md`
- `docs/features/life-explorer/DATA_MODEL.md`
- `docs/features/life-explorer/DAILY_WORKFLOW.md`
- `docs/features/life-explorer/AGENT_RULES.md`

## Critical

**Do not confuse more content with a better lesson. The best lesson is the smallest complete experience that keeps the parent prepared, the child engaged, and the learning documented.**

- Never invent resource titles, URLs, page numbers, or runtimes.
- Do not force every subject into every lesson.
- Never tell the parent they are “behind.”
- Preserve child language on Wonder Wall “Know” items.
- Leave `homeschool/oliver-ocean-adventures/` untouched.
- Product home is Vibration Fit only — not Company Engineers KB.
